{"id": "65563", "title": "仇恋君", "author": "言绝魅", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65563.htm", "intro": "她、是被他占领的小国的王族之后。\r\n\r\n打从第一眼，她的美便萦绕他的心。\r\n\r\n她的倔强更引起他的征服欲。\r\n\r\n国家都拿下了，驯服一个亡国之女有什么难的？\r\n\r\n他，是弑父弑母的仇人！\r\n\r\n他毁了她的国家，\r\n\r\n复仇是她活着的唯一希望。\r\n\r\n她恨他，用尽所有力气恨他，\r\n\r\n但当恨到了尽头，\r\n\r\n当心渐渐难以驾驭，\r\n\r\n她又该如何自处？", "base": "files/article/html/65/65563", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9755220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-13", "file": "9755222.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-18", "file": "9755224.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-24", "file": "9755226.html", "available": false}, {"title": "25-32", "file": "9755228.html", "available": false}, {"title": "33-40", "file": "9755230.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-47", "file": "9755232.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-54", "file": "9755234.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-62", "file": "9755236.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-71", "file": "9755238.html", "available": false}, {"title": "72-79", "file": "9755239.html", "available": false}, {"title": "80-86完结", "file": "9755241.html", "available": false}]}